CLAUDE.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
*.db
.env
checkpoints/
wandb/
.pytest_cache/
.claude/

# corpora fetched at runtime by data loaders, not source
transformer_scratch/data/*.txt

# Baseline/eval run output. The results JSON *is* committed - it is the record
# every later comparison is made against, and a number in the README that
# nobody can inspect is not much better than an unsourced one. These two are
# not: the rollouts checkpoint is raw material for re-scoring a run on the
# machine that produced it, and the transcripts are a 4MB human-reading
# artifact. Both regenerate from the committed suite plus the command in the
# README.
artifacts/**/*.rollouts.json
artifacts/**/*_transcripts.txt
